# ---------- 7. 兜底排除 ----------
**/keystore/
**/keystore.properties
**/local.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.apk
**/*.elf
**/*.map
**/*.kate-swp
**/*.swp

